forum-edit-heading = Edit your message in “{ $title }”
forum-compose-help = Write your message and review it below. Nothing is published until you choose Publish or Save changes.
forum-draft-title = Title: { $title }. Activate to change it.
forum-not-written = Not written yet
forum-write-body = Write or change message
forum-publish = Publish
forum-save-edit = Save changes
forum-title-prompt = Discussion title (up to 120 characters).
forum-body-prompt = Your message (up to 8000 characters). Submit to review before publishing.
forum-published = Your message was published.
forum-edit-saved = Your changes were saved.
forum-discard-prompt = Discard this draft? Its title and message will be lost.
forum-draft-discarded = Draft discarded.
forum-error-account = The forum requires an approved account without an active ban.
forum-error-muted = You cannot publish or edit forum messages while your account is muted.
forum-error-missing = This discussion or message is no longer available to you. Return to the forum to choose another.
forum-error-title-length = The title must be text of at most { $limit } characters.
forum-error-body-length = The message must be text of at most { $limit } characters.
forum-error-title-empty = Write a title before publishing your discussion.
forum-error-body-empty = Write a message before publishing.
forum-error-text-controls = Remove unsupported control characters from your text and try again.
forum-error-search = Enter between 2 and { $limit } characters to search discussions.
forum-error-rate = You have sent several messages recently. Wait up to { $seconds } seconds before publishing again. Your draft is still here.
forum-error-duplicate = You have just published this same message. Your draft has been kept for review.
forum-error-closed = This discussion was closed. New replies and author edits are disabled. Your draft is still here.
forum-error-edit-permission = You can edit your own visible messages for 30 minutes. Moderators can edit later.
forum-error-conflict = This message changed after you opened the editor. Your draft is still here; copy it before reopening the current message.
forum-error-moderator = Only a current administrator or developer can moderate forum discussions.
forum-open-help = Open for replies
forum-entry-home = { forum-heading }. { forum-intro }
forum-entry-topics = { $title }. { forum-topic-count }. Page { $page } of { $pages }. { $empty }
forum-entry-search = { $title }. { forum-search-query }. { forum-topic-count }. Page { $page } of { $pages }. { $empty }
forum-entry-thread = { $title }. { forum-thread-meta } { $status }. Page { $page } of { $pages }.
forum-entry-post = { $title }. { forum-post-meta }. { $edited }
forum-entry-composer = { $heading }. { forum-compose-help }
